    <description>A two-season AI value-creation apprenticeship for operators who need to connect product judgment, production AI, operating design, scaling, and private-equity returns. Season One puts you inside Harborline Systems from underwrite to exit. Season Two, Portfolio Control, promotes you into a three-company operating-partner simulation where capital, agents, talent, platform boundaries, regulation, M&amp;A, and fund liquidity collide. Every episode gives you incomplete evidence, forces a decision, and carries the consequences forward.</description>
    <itunes:subtitle>From Company to Portfolio. Every Decision Compounds.</itunes:subtitle>
    <itunes:author>Asha Raman &amp; Cole Mercer</itunes:author>
